or invalidate old ones, they are rather unimportant. Readers of sci.physics
should take note of Alexander Abian and his "TIME HAS INERTIA, ALL PARTICLES
HAVE  A FUNDAMENTAL NEED FOR SECURITY. Therefore, planets stay close to the
sun [womb], electrons stay close to the nucleus, etc." stuff. His
crackpot theories are very close to carol's only he takes it a step further
by fully anthropomophing subatomic particles. For example, his explanation
of how matches work is, "combustable material wants to preserve the status
quo for a feeling of security. If you start rubbing it, it tries to make
you stop by attempting to burn you." Ditto for Nuclear bombs.
   Prof Abian was on the news last year for suggesting that we drop the
moon in the ocean to straighten the Earth's axis and eliminate seasonal
changes. Now he is on a new campaign promoting the idea that we move
Venus to Earth's orbit to make it "born again."

  What is astonishing is that this guy is a fully accreditied scientist who
has written good text books in the fields of abstract algebra. He is also
